    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95592" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σόλος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mass</i> or <i>lump of
			iron</i>, used in throwing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σόλον αὐτοχόωνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.826
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				839
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				844
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eumel.
				9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				1541
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Olympia</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Sosith.
				3.2
			</span></i>; distinguished (but not clearly) from the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίσκος</span> by Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.774
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				23.826
			</span></i>; in <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέγαν περιηγέα πέτρον, . .
				σόλον Ἄρεος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.1366
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σόλος</span> seems 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίσκος</span>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				905
			</span></i> (et Sch.), <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				4.436
			</span></i>.</div>
